# Both Dockerfiles build from the repository root, so keep the context small.
# npm dependencies and every generated bundle are rebuilt inside the image.
.git
# Sibling clones a developer may keep beside the sources; the images take both
# libraries from their wheels
pixelflux/
pcmflux/
**/node_modules
**/dist
# OTA: Der gebaute Web-Client ist Teil unseres Forks und muss mit in den
# Baukontext des Basisimages (OTA-FORK.md).
# src/selkies/selkies_web/
src/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.ruff_cache
**/.next
build/
out/
release/
release-artifacts/
AppDir/
infra/appimage/AppDir/
